{
 "hook-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.467,
  "audioFrames": 224,
  "duration": 242,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "两个人同时伸手，抢同一件 T 恤。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.836,
    "src": "ch1-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "数据库里也一样：好几个人可能同时要改同一条数据。",
    "start": 3.116,
    "dur": 4.353,
    "src": "ch1-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "lost-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.433,
  "audioFrames": 283,
  "duration": 291,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "lost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "两个店员都看了一眼吊牌，各自改了价钱，再贴回去。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.1,
    "src": "ch2-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "后贴的那张，把先贴的盖住了，前一个人的改动就这么没了。",
    "start": 4.38,
    "dur": 5.042,
    "src": "ch2-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "lost-2": {
  "audioSec": 1.733,
  "audioFrames": 52,
  "duration": 92,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 291,
  "chapter": "lost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这叫丢失更新。",
    "start": 0.002,
    "dur": 1.726,
    "src": "ch2-3"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 70,
  "holdAt": 70,
  "extraHold": 22,
  "labelHold": 22
 },
 "xlock-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.267,
  "audioFrames": 278,
  "duration": 287,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "xlock",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "办法是：先到的人，在 T 恤上挂一把锁。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.206,
    "src": "ch3-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "锁着的时候，别人想改它，只能等他这一单做完、把锁打开。",
    "start": 4.486,
    "dur": 4.786,
    "src": "ch3-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "xlock-2": {
  "audioSec": 3.667,
  "audioFrames": 110,
  "duration": 149,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 287,
  "chapter": "xlock",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这把只许一个人动的锁，叫写锁。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.672,
    "src": "ch3-3"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 128,
  "holdAt": 128,
  "extraHold": 21,
  "labelHold": 21
 },
 "slock-1": {
  "audioSec": 6.9,
  "audioFrames": 207,
  "duration": 215,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "slock",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "要是大家只是想看，就没必要一个个排队。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.132,
    "src": "ch4-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "几个人可以一起围着看，但谁也不能拿走去改。",
    "start": 3.412,
    "dur": 3.477,
    "src": "ch4-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "slock-2": {
  "audioSec": 3.0,
  "audioFrames": 90,
  "duration": 141,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 215,
  "chapter": "slock",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这种能一起持有的锁，叫读锁。",
    "start": 0.002,
    "dur": 2.986,
    "src": "ch4-3"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 107,
  "holdAt": 107,
  "extraHold": 34,
  "labelHold": 34
 },
 "scope-1": {
  "audioSec": 6.433,
  "audioFrames": 193,
  "duration": 201,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "scope",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "锁也分大小。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.457,
    "src": "ch5-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "只锁这一件 T 恤，叫行锁，旁边的货大家照样拿。",
    "start": 1.737,
    "dur": 4.687,
    "src": "ch5-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "scope-2": {
  "audioSec": 5.367,
  "audioFrames": 161,
  "duration": 179,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 201,
  "chapter": "scope",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "把整个货架都锁上，叫表锁，想改别的货也得一起等。",
    "start": 0.004,
    "dur": 5.358,
    "src": "ch5-3"
   }
  ]
 },
 "dead-1": {
  "audioSec": 4.567,
  "audioFrames": 137,
  "duration": 146,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "dead",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "排队等，总有轮到的时候；等得太久，就先放弃这一步。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.575,
    "src": "ch6-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "dead-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.867,
  "audioFrames": 266,
  "duration": 310,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 146,
  "chapter": "dead",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "可要是两个人各攥着一件，又都伸手要对方那件，谁也不松手，就永远等下去了。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.038,
    "src": "ch6-2"
   },
   {
    "text": "这叫死锁。",
    "start": 7.306,
    "dur": 1.566,
    "src": "ch6-3"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 284,
  "holdAt": 284,
  "extraHold": 26,
  "labelHold": 26
 },
 "resolve-1": {
  "audioSec": 10.1,
  "audioFrames": 303,
  "duration": 321,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "resolve",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "数据库会发现这种僵局，挑其中一单整单撤回，再由程序重新来一次。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.975,
    "src": "ch7-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "这就是上期说的，撞车了只能整单重来。",
    "start": 6.255,
    "dur": 3.829,
    "src": "ch7-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "pessimistic-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.233,
  "audioFrames": 247,
  "duration": 291,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "pessimistic",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "前面这些，都是先挂锁、再动手：宁可少几个人同时干，也要先保证安全。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.705,
    "src": "ch8-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "这种思路叫悲观锁。",
    "start": 5.985,
    "dur": 2.238,
    "src": "ch8-2"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 265,
  "holdAt": 265,
  "extraHold": 26,
  "labelHold": 26
 },
 "optimistic-1": {
  "audioSec": 10.3,
  "audioFrames": 309,
  "duration": 317,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "optimistic",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "还有一种思路：不挂锁，直接拿去改。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.245,
    "src": "ch9-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "放回去的时候，看一眼吊牌有没有被别人换过；换过了，就重新拿一次再改。",
    "start": 3.525,
    "dur": 6.759,
    "src": "ch9-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "optimistic-2": {
  "audioSec": 2.867,
  "audioFrames": 86,
  "duration": 126,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 317,
  "chapter": "optimistic",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这种做法，通常叫乐观锁。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.883,
    "src": "ch9-3"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 104,
  "holdAt": 104,
  "extraHold": 22,
  "labelHold": 22
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 11.067,
  "audioFrames": 332,
  "duration": 340,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "写锁只许一个人改，读锁大家一起看；锁可以只锁一行，也可以锁整张表；先挂锁是悲观，放回时再检查是乐观。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 11.069,
    "src": "ch10-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.733,
  "audioFrames": 142,
  "duration": 202,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 340,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "想少遇到死锁，最好的办法是：大家都按同一个顺序拿货。",
    "start": 0.016,
    "dur": 4.711,
    "src": "ch10-2"
   }
  ]
 }
}